## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": ["fixVersion.grit"],
  "json": { "linter": { "enabled": true } },
  "linter": {
    "rules": { "recommended": false }
  },
  "formatter": { "enabled": false }
}
```

## `fixVersion.grit`

```grit
language json

`"1.0.0"` as $version where {
    register_diagnostic(
        span = $version,
        message = "Update version.",
        severity = "warn"
    ),
    $version => `"2.0.0"`
}

```

